## Tips

- All links are **Auction + Sold + Ended Recently** — real hammer prices
- Buy It Now typically runs 15-25% higher than auction prices
- **Skip outliers:** mining bulk lots, "for parts", international-only
- **Blower vs open-air:** 3090 blower cards sell $50-100 cheaper (hotter/louder)
- **Update quarterly** or when major GPU launches disrupt used market
- **Low/Mid/High:** Low = bottom 20% of sales, Mid = median, High = top 20%
